  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "西班牙文(一)",
    "sub_ename": "SPANISH(1)",
    "describe_ch": "透過與日常生活相關的對話和基礎文法概念的結合，引導學生吸收並理解西語詞彙和語意。\r透過發音學習，培養學生可以正確發音與朗讀簡短文章之能力。\r藉由基礎日常生活的會話，加強學生聽說的表達能力。\r透過基礎西語的習得，讓學生可以進一步認識西班牙和拉丁美洲國家的風俗民情及文化。\r主題包括發音、一般問候語、自我介紹、道別、表達個人意見及偏好等，於期末學生應能運用基礎的西班牙文做簡短的自我介紹和進行基礎的對話。",
    "describe_eh": "1.To train students to learn and understand the meanings of Spanish vocabulary and sentences with daily life conversations and concepts of grammar\r\n2.To build up students’ abilities to read out loud short articles with correct pronunciation\r\n3.To improve students’ abilities to express themselves with the practice of daily conversations\r\n4.To further understand the customs and culture of Spain and Latin America\r\nThe course includes pronunciation, greetings, self-introduction, saying goodbye, expressing one’s opinions and preferences, etc. At the end of the semester, students would be able to briefly introduce themselves and start a basic conversation.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
